OL,3,A'Potential crime' probe into death of
OL,4,AScots wingsuit flyer dropped
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn investigation into any potential
OL,7,Fcrime after the death of a Scottish
OL,8,Fwingsuit flyer during a jump in the
OL,9,FSwiss Alps has been dropped.
OL,11,FBritish champion Liam Byrne, 24, was
OL,12,Ffatally injured on the Gitschen
OL,13,Fmountain after taking off from 7,874ft
OL,14,F(2,400m) in June last year.
OL,16,FAn investigation was launched, but
OL,17,Fdocuments from the Swiss Federal
OL,18,FProsecutor's Office seen by BBC
OL,19,FScotland News show it was decided to
OL,20,Fdiscontinue proceedings.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,0,100
